@page
@model GovEthicsPolicyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The Khurshid Institute - Governance and Ethics Policy";
}

<div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
    <h1>Governance and Ethics Policy</h1>
</div>

<div>
    <p>
        At The Khurshid Institute, we abide by the following governance and ethical framework that guides organizational decision-making, client engagements, and operational practices in the context of the public sector.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Governance Principles</p>
            <p>Our governance approach is grounded in:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Accountability to clients and stakeholders</li>
                <li>Transparency in decision-making and reporting</li>
                <li>Clear roles, responsibilities, and oversight</li>
                <li>Ethical use of data and technology</li>
            </ul>
            <br/>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Ethical Decision-Making</p>
            <p>All decisions are assessed based on:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Alignment with the public interest</li>
                <li>Legal and regulatory compliance</li>
                <li>Ethical implications and reputational risk</li>
                <li>Impact on equity, accessibility, and inclusion</li>
            </ul>
            <br/>
            <p>Where uncertainty exists, decisions default to the most transparent and conservative ethical option.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Data Ethics and Responsible Technology Use</p>
            <p>Data Ethics and Responsible Technology Use:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Using data responsibly and proportionately</li>
                <li>Avoiding opaque or non-explainable decision systems</li>
                <li>Ensuring human oversight in analytics and automation</li>
                <li>Designing systems that support fairness and accountability</li>
            </ul>
            <br/>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Privacy and Information Management</p>
            <p>We respect privacy rights and information governance obligations, including:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Proper data handling and retention</li>
                <li>Secure access controls</li>
                <li>Compliance with applicable privacy and access legislation</li>
                <li>Support for audit and reporting requirements</li>
            </ul>
            <br/>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Oversight and Continuous Improvement</p>
            <p>Governance and ethics practices are reviewed regularly to ensure alignment with evolving public-sector standards, legislation, and community expectations.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="bullet-highlight">Reporting and Escalation</p>
            <p>Concerns related to ethics, governance, or compliance may be raised without fear of retaliation and will be addressed promptly and responsibly.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>